{"code":"RD03","wikidata":"Q6633300","wikipedia":{"en":"Taling Chan railway station","th":"สถานีตลิ่งชัน"},"summary":{"en":"Taling Chan Station is a railway station located in Taling Chan District, Bangkok. It is operated by the State Railway of Thailand and serves two routes: the Southern Main Line and the Bang Sue–Taling Chan SRT Light Red Line.","th":"สถานีตลิ่งชัน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้าชานเมือง สายนครวิถี และรถไฟทางไกลสายใต้ เปิดให้บริการเมื่อวันที่ 2 สิงหาคม พ.ศ."},"opened":"1903-06-19","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Taling_Chan_Railway_Station_20211114-1.jpg/960px-Taling_Chan_Railway_Station_20211114-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taling_Chan_Railway_Station_20211114-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/202302_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_from_the_East.jpg/960px-202302_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_from_the_East.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:202302_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_from_the_East.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/202402_Commuter_Train_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_Station.jpg/960px-202402_Commuter_Train_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:202402_Commuter_Train_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/202402_Exit_on_Conventional_Yard_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_Station.jpg/960px-202402_Exit_on_Conventional_Yard_Platform_of_Taling_Chan_Junction_Station.jpg?utm_source=co